p, 30-amp, and 50-amp s", "te Park and Twin Harbors State Park both offer yurts (and Twin Harbors has cabins) reservable through Washington State Parks. | How much do campgrounds near Grayland cost? | Overnight rates at Kenanna RV Resort start at $19.60/night, with monthly rates from $822/month for extended stays, making it one of the most affordable campgrounds on the Washington coast. State park campgrounds typically run higher per night dep", "n the Washington coast. Full hookups with 50-amp service, a rainforest trail out the back door, pet-friendly sites with no restrictions, and a team that treats guests like regulars from day one. Overnight rates start at $19.60, and monthly stays start at $822. | See all site types, rates, and live availability on the Kenanna RV Resort page . | | Book Your Campsite (360) 360-2802 RJourney Kenanna RV Resort by RJourney", ". | See all site types, rates, and live availability on the Kenanna RV Resort page . | | Book Your Campsite (360) 360-2802 RJourney Kenanna RV Resort by RJourney | 2959 WA-105, Grayland, WA 98547 4.5 stars · 378 reviews $19.60 per night $822 per month Check Availability (360) 360-2802 Property Details | Season Year-round Hookups Full (20/30/50A) Sites Pull-through, Back-in, Tent Pets No limit on number of pets Office", "Horseshoes Nature Trails Firewood Sales Full Hookups Pull-Through Sites 50-Amp Service On This Page | Kenanna RV Resort by RJourney | Amenities | Other Parks | Things to Do | Seasonal Guide | Practical Tips | FAQ | From $19.60 /night Kenanna RV Resort by RJourney View Park Book Now Hit the road with insider tips, exclusive deals, and new park alerts — straight to your inbox. | Join the Rjourney Social | Ways to Stay "], "via": "campgrounds near Grayland"}]}
